===England vs Belgium===

England looked set for victory when they led 3-1 early in the second half. But defensive lapses handed their opponents two simple goals, which took the game into extra time. Nat Lofthouse then edged England back in front before an unlucky headed own goal by Jimmy Dickinson handed the Belgians a draw.<ref>[https://books.google.com/books?id=6B38AwAAQBAJ Google Books: 'England in the World Cup 1950-2014']</ref>

